		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_DECISIONS_UC_IRAQ_MAKTAB">
			<Text>Develop Maktabs</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_DECISIONS_UC_IRAQ_MAKTAB_DESC">
			<Text>
				In order to continue to improving the education of our citizens, we will develop Maktabs, elementary schools, around our universities.[NEWLINE]
				[NEWLINE]Requirement/Restrictions:
				[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Player must be Iraq
				[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Must be in at least the Renaissance Era
				[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]May only be enacted once per game
				[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]May have at least 3 Nezamiyyehs
				[NEWLINE]Costs:
				[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]2 [ICON_MAGISTRATES] Magistrates
				[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]{1_Num} [ICON_GOLD] Gold
				[NEWLINE]Rewards:
				[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]+2 [ICON_RESEARCH] Science from Nezamiyyehs and Academies
			</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_DECISIONS_UC_IRAQ_MAKTAB_ENACTED_DESC">
			<Text>
				In order to continue to improving the education of our citizens, we will develop Maktabs, elementary schools, around our universities.[NEWLINE]
				[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]+2 [ICON_RESEARCH] Science from Nezamiyyehs and Academies
			</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_DECISIONS_UC_IRAQ_OIL">
			<Text>Nationalize the Oil Industry</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_DECISIONS_UC_IRAQ_OIL_DESC">
			<Text>
				With the recent discovery of oil in our lands, we must nationalize the industry to ensure maximum revenue and efficiency.[NEWLINE]
				[NEWLINE]Requirement/Restrictions:
				[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Player must be Iraq
				[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]May only be enacted once per game
				[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Must have at least 6 sources of [ICON_RES_OIL] Oil
				[NEWLINE]Costs:
				[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]2 [ICON_MAGISTRATES] Magistrates
				[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]300 [ICON_CULTURE] Culture
				[NEWLINE]Rewards:
				[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]+2 [ICON_GOLD] Gold and +1 [ICON_PRODUCTION] Production from improved sources of [ICON_RES_OIL] Oil
				[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]{1_Num} [ICON_GOLD] Gold (increases with number of [ICON_RES_OIL] Oil)
			</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_DECISIONS_UC_IRAQ_OIL_ENACTED_DESC">
			<Text>
				With the recent discovery of oil in our lands, we must nationalize the industry to ensure maximum revenue and efficiency.[NEWLINE]
				[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]+2 [ICON_GOLD] Gold and +1 [ICON_PRODUCTION] Production from improved sources of [ICON_RES_OIL] Oil
